#: src/Admin/StatsCard.php
msgid "Counted by a small signal the browser sends after the page has loaded, so it works with page caches and CDNs too. No cookie, no IP address and nothing personal is kept: only how many visits each language and page had each day, and the language of the visitor's browser. Robots, search engines and you (the administrators) are not counted. Days older than 400 are deleted by themselves."
msgstr "Dihitung lewat sinyal kecil yang dikirim browser setelah halaman dimuat, jadi juga berfungsi dengan cache halaman dan CDN. Tidak ada cookie, alamat IP, atau data pribadi yang disimpan: hanya jumlah kunjungan tiap bahasa dan halaman per hari, serta bahasa browser pengunjung. Robot, mesin pencari, dan Anda (administrator) tidak dihitung. Data yang lebih lama dari 400 hari terhapus sendiri."

#: src/Admin/StatsCard.php
msgid "No visits counted yet: they appear here from the next visit on."
msgstr "Belum ada kunjungan yang dihitung: akan muncul di sini mulai kunjungan berikutnya."

#: src/Admin/StatsCard.php
